    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portabellows is an adventure of <strong>exploration</strong> and a <strong>collectathon</strong>. Find recipes and ingredients to bake pies, and help quirky castaway residents off the island. Discover the mystery of what's keeping them there. New abilities will help you access more and more whimsical areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.poster.avif?t=1753900608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.webm?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.mp4?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Erma, retired, relaxing by the beach in your quiet retirement island paradise when you see a <strong>plane falling out of the sky</strong>. There starts your adventure, following clues as to where the plane landed (certainly not in one piece) and help out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.poster.avif?t=1753900608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.webm?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.mp4?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help new friends by collecting everything</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>jelly beans</strong> in the world to trade for useful items and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete collections that your new friends need or desire: missing plane pieces, relics and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be rewarded by a shopkeeper with cute assortments of <strong>outfits</strong>   </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Platforming Fun</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.poster.avif?t=1753900608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.webm?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.mp4?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore every corner of the island: jump, sprint, swim, and more to traverse\u00a0 scenic landscapes full of <strong>mushrooms</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be wary of environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procure new <strong>abilities</strong> by exploring every path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be victorious in challenge rooms, mysteriously in place to recover <strong>lost treasures</strong>: platforming challenges and puzzles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather ingredients to bake pies fit for a deity</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.poster.avif?t=1753900608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.webm?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.mp4?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find them in every nook and cranny of the island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>mysterious seeds</strong> and plant them to get ingredients you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain eggs as a reward for reuniting all lost chicklings with their mama</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill in the pages of your <strong>journal</strong> by discovering new ingredients, recipes and gardening techniques</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pie Making</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your ingredients to bake delicious pies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mini-games to accomplish every pie making step</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a team of two, this is our passion project and we can't wait for you to enjoy your time in Portabellows! We hope to tickle your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portabellows is an adventure of <strong>exploration</strong> and a <strong>collectathon</strong>. Find recipes and ingredients to bake pies, and help quirky castaway residents off the island. Discover the mystery of what's keeping them there. New abilities will help you access more and more whimsical areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.poster.avif?t=1753900608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.webm?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.mp4?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Erma, retired, relaxing by the beach in your quiet retirement island paradise when you see a <strong>plane falling out of the sky</strong>. There starts your adventure, following clues as to where the plane landed (certainly not in one piece) and help out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.poster.avif?t=1753900608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.webm?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.mp4?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help new friends by collecting everything</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>jelly beans</strong> in the world to trade for useful items and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete collections that your new friends need or desire: missing plane pieces, relics and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be rewarded by a shopkeeper with cute assortments of <strong>outfits</strong>   </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Platforming Fun</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.poster.avif?t=1753900608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.webm?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.mp4?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore every corner of the island: jump, sprint, swim, and more to traverse\u00a0 scenic landscapes full of <strong>mushrooms</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be wary of environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procure new <strong>abilities</strong> by exploring every path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be victorious in challenge rooms, mysteriously in place to recover <strong>lost treasures</strong>: platforming challenges and puzzles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather ingredients to bake pies fit for a deity</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.poster.avif?t=1753900608\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.webm?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.mp4?t=1753900608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find them in every nook and cranny of the island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>mysterious seeds</strong> and plant them to get ingredients you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain eggs as a reward for reuniting all lost chicklings with their mama</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill in the pages of your <strong>journal</strong> by discovering new ingredients, recipes and gardening techniques</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pie Making</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your ingredients to bake delicious pies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mini-games to accomplish every pie making step</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a team of two, this is our passion project and we can't wait for you to enjoy your time in Portabellows! We hope to tickle your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a whimsical island to find\u2026 pie recipes?! Bake them by gathering or growing ingredients, which may be the key to helping out your new found quirky friends leave the island! In this wholesome 3D platformer collectathon, you can enjoy discovering the world freely at your own pace.",
